I'm playing my 8th level elf.  Searching for missile weapons to finish the 
priestess off in the temple in the gnome mine town.  (I'd converted the
alter earlier, and she was really ticked.)  I'm wandering around and my 
mind wanders a bit and I run right into a floating eye.  Boom, paralysed, 
boom dwarf beets me to death, and thats all she wrote.

Everytime I start to enjoy this game I die.  Ussually its an educational 
experience.  This one is just anoying.  You get asked to confirm when you
attack non hostile monsters, why can't I get prompted for floating eyes?

Is this an unfair complaint?


